  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Conference on climate Change, Peace and Security in West Africa &amp; the Sahel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus for the Conference was on defining the adverse implications of climate change on human security in West Africa and the Sahel and identifying options for strengthening responses to climate-security risks in the region from a conflict prevention and peacebuilding perspective. Africa Unit supported the conference with funding under the ASIF.</narrative>
  </description>
